{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize: A 17th Century City Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the calm yet challenging life of the first settlers in the New World.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colonize</strong> is a relaxing building strategy combined with survival elements, set during the iconic colonization period of the 17th century. Step into the shoes of a colony leader and guide your people through the hardships of a new land. This is a game for those who enjoy <strong>thoughtful planning, resource management, and the satisfaction of watching a settlement grow</strong> without the stress of combat or warfare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/ce2df6c2ca3cd600f6f23ac89d56a7a4.poster.avif?t=1770208887\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/ce2df6c2ca3cd600f6f23ac89d56a7a4.webm?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/ce2df6c2ca3cd600f6f23ac89d56a7a4.mp4?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build. Manage. Thrive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on what matters: the prosperity of your people. In Colonize, there are <strong>no enemies and no soldiers</strong>. Your greatest challenge is the environment itself, the economy, and the well-being of your citizens.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Locations:</strong> Embark on a journey through three distinct levels\u2014<strong>Roanoke, Plymouth, and Bermuda</strong>. Each brings its own atmosphere and specific conditions to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Economic Simulation:</strong> Manage your resources wisely. Establish production chains, refine raw materials, and ensure your colony is self-sufficient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade with the Old World:</strong> Expand your possibilities by trading with England. Larger ships mean better trade deals, but also more mouths to feed and lives to manage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Experience:</strong> Whether you want a completely stress-free building session or a more demanding survival challenge, you can <strong>adjust the difficulty</strong> to suit your preferred playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/f323188992ef9312a319e297ce163625.poster.avif?t=1770208887\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/f323188992ef9312a319e297ce163625.webm?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/f323188992ef9312a319e297ce163625.mp4?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from the Developers:</strong> We are a small team dedicated to creating a focused, atmospheric building experience. We value your feedback and would love to hear your thoughts on how to further polish the game. Join our <strong>Discord server</strong> to chat with us directly and stay updated on bug fixes and improvements! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/16b3fa6e6c3995d80c75fb89bdcbe74c.poster.avif?t=1770208887\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/16b3fa6e6c3995d80c75fb89bdcbe74c.webm?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/extras/16b3fa6e6c3995d80c75fb89bdcbe74c.mp4?t=1770208887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is supported using public funding by the Slovak Arts Council.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1573590?t=1770208887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1573590?t=1770208887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/f31708c9b8343cee5e209a57669a722e3603862c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770208887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1573590/f31708c9b8343cee5e209a57669a722e3603862c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770208887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize: A 17th Century City Builder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the calm yet challenging life of the first settlers in the New World.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colonize</strong> is a relaxing building strategy combined with survival elements, set during the iconic colonization period of the 17th century. Step into the shoes of a colony leader and guide your people through the hardships of a new land. This is a game for those who enjoy <strong>thoughtful planning, resource management, and the satisfaction of watching a settlement grow</strong> without the stress of combat or warfare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-alig